        },
        {
          "id": 3077270910,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Only applies to the manual uninstall. Been there forever.  \nThis MR was just to clarify that it's not all plugins, just global affected.  \n  \n![260209_win_app_uninstall](/uploads/09805ed89021a8b25f27b48798ecedf8/260209_win_app_uninstall.jpg){width=499 height=388}",
